</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name="sign-VHL"> </a></b>Sign VHL</td><td>SHALL</td><td><div><p>Sign the VHL payload to produce a verifiable and cryptographically bound artifact.</p>
</div></td></tr></table></div>
